## CampaignsApi

### Get pins analytics
## Get pins analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/pins/analytics?campaignId={{campaignId}}&pinIds={{pinIds}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}
Accept: application/json

### Get targeting analytics for campaigns
## Get targeting analytics for campaigns
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaigns/targeting_analytics?campaignIds={{campaignIds}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&targetingTypes={{targetingTypes}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&attributionTypes={{attributionTypes}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}
Accept: application/json

### Get campaign analytics
## Get campaign analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaigns/analytics?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&campaignIds={{campaignIds}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&aggregateReportRows={{aggregateReportRows}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}
Accept: application/json

### Create campaigns
## Create campaigns
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get campaign
## Get campaign
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaigns/{{campaign_id}}
Accept: application/json

### List campaigns
## List campaigns
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaigns?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&campaignIds={{campaignIds}}&entityStatuses={{entityStatuses}}
Accept: application/json

### Update campaigns
## Update campaigns
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get campaign delivery estimates
## Get campaign delivery estimates
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaigns/delivery_estimates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}

